E7 gate run, increment 21 (the resume half) — 2026-11-01
Two boots of sls_operating_system_e3.iso (E3_INIT_FEATURES=e3_envs,e7_gate) on a 10 GiB NVMe image,
-m 1G -smp 2 -accel tcg; the checkpoint is written by boot 1 and replayed by boot 2.
The resumed tenant is reaped by name: [TORE] ... 172 frame(s) freed (the reap fix).
The pre-pour wait is stall-bounded: this run took its parked posture on the first pass (no wait ended line).

